@lang en
IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `ito-il27-nouns`
IMPORT `ito-il27-tax-years`

-- ===========================================================================
-- Income Tax Ordinance s 44 — "זיכוי בעד הוצאות החזקת קרוב במוסד", the credit for keeping a relative in an institution. Row IL-27.
-- Source lines 1703-1705.
--
-- A resident individual who, or whose spouse, paid in the tax year to keep in a special institution a child, spouse or parent who is totally
-- paralysed, permanently bedridden, blind or insane, or to keep a child with an intellectual-developmental disability, gets a tax credit
-- of 35% of the part of those sums that exceeds 12.5% of his taxable income. The Minister may set conditions by regulations: the
-- regulations of 5756-1996 (line 1705) are not in the source bundle, so the caller states whether their conditions are met; where not
-- known, the rule declines unless the credit is nil whatever the regulations say. The consolidation's note gives income ceilings for the
-- regulations (ito-il27-published-figures.l4); no rule uses them.
-- The sums are the total paid for all the qualifying relatives; whether each is a qualifying relative is the caller's.
-- ===========================================================================

§ `Section 44 — keeping a relative in an institution`

-- src:1704 | בחישוב הכנסתו החייבת של יחיד תושב ישראל שהוא או בן זוגו שילם בשנת המס בעד החזקתם במוסד מיוחד של ילד, בן זוג או הורה משותקים לחלוטין, מרותקים למיטה בתמידות, עיוורים או בלתי שפויים בדעתם, וכן בשל החזקת ילד עם מוגבלות שכלית–התפתחותית במוסד מיוחד, יותר לו זיכוי ממס של 35% מאותו חלק מהסכומים שהוא או בן זוגו שילם העולה על 12.5% מהכנסתו החייבת; שר האוצר רשאי לקבוע בתקנות תנאים לזכאות לזיכוי ממס על פי סעיף זה.

@ref ITO s 44, lines 1704-1705 — the regulations of 5756-1996 are not in the source bundle (needs a source)
GIVEN a IS A TYPE
GIVETH AN a
`section 44 lets the Minister set conditions by regulations, the regulations of 5756-1996 are not in the source bundle, and here they may decide` MEANS
    REFUSE "section 44 lets the Minister set conditions by regulations, the regulations of 5756-1996 are not in the source bundle, and here they may decide"

-- 35% of the part of the sums that exceeds 12.5% of the taxable income.
@ref ITO s 44, line 1704
GIVEN t IS A `A taxpayer who paid to keep a relative in an institution, for section 44`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`s 44 — the credit before the conditions of the regulations, for` t MEANS
    IF   t's `an Israeli resident in the tax year`
    THEN 35% TIMES max 0 (t's `sums he or his spouse paid in the tax year to keep a qualifying relative in a special institution` MINUS 12.5% TIMES t's `taxable income`)
    ELSE 0

@export The credit under Income Tax Ordinance s 44 (keeping a relative in a special institution) for a tax year from 2024, in NIS: 35% of the part of the sums paid that exceeds 12.5% of taxable income, for a resident individual; declines where the conditions of the regulations of 5756-1996, which are not in the source bundle, may decide, and for a foreign worker (s 48A)
@ref ITO s 44, lines 1703-1705
GIVEN t IS A `A taxpayer who paid to keep a relative in an institution, for section 44`
          @desc the tax year, residence, the sums paid in the year to keep qualifying relatives in a special institution, the taxable income, and whether the conditions of the regulations are met
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the credit under section 44 for` t MEANS
    `for tax year` (t's `tax year`) `, row IL-27 answers`
        (`the points, unless section 48A may take them from a foreign worker:` (t's `a foreign worker`) `,` `the credit`)
    WHERE
        `the credit` MEANS
            CONSIDER t's `the conditions of the regulations made under section 44`
            WHEN `met`       THEN `s 44 — the credit before the conditions of the regulations, for` t
            WHEN `not met`   THEN 0
            WHEN `not known` THEN
                IF   `s 44 — the credit before the conditions of the regulations, for` t EQUALS 0
                THEN 0
                ELSE `section 44 lets the Minister set conditions by regulations, the regulations of 5756-1996 are not in the source bundle, and here they may decide`
